// GAP-ZYE-015: how a frame reaches the terminal. After each key the probe clears the screen
// and draws 23 rows with `>>~`, the shape of every full redraw; check.py counts the write
// calls the engine makes to show it.
>>| {
    @ {
        <<| k
        ? k == 'q' { @! }
        code = ##!k
        >>!
        @ i:1..23 { >>~ (i, 1, 0, 244, 0) > "row {i} after key {code}" }
    }
}
